oute, the handler and the OpenCode plugin emit the directives fallback instead of a brief. An unparseable payload, an unhandled error or a shim that cannot relay its child resolves to `{}`. Every adapter honors the `skill-advisor` kill-switch, default-on.\\n38:4. **CLI front door.** The hook calls `buildSkillAdvisorBriefFromCli`, which runs `skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --json - --no-warm-only` within the `SPECKIT_CLAUDE_HOOK_TIMEOUT_MS` budget (2,500 ms by default). It writes the request to the CLI's stdin, so the prompt never appears in the process table. The request carries at most the prompt's first 10,000 characters, the most `advisor_recommend` accepts, so a longer prompt is routed on its head instead of failing open. The Claude shim sets the child budget to 2,200 ms when the operator has not set the variable. An operator value above about 2,200 ms lets the shim kill the hook at 2,500 ms first, so the turn gets `{}`. The CLI owns the warm-daemon probe, starts th...\n  Line 153: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794551141123,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2c799690ffeJQrMJ5OzboPGaV\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d3954ea80016sZydve8XBRyVo\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2c799690ffeJQrMJ5OzboPGaV\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d394eaf0001xuKlWpJZC9cWvs\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_92bed05d0b8c483bbe970462\",\"tool\":\"shell\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \\\"policy\\\\|mutating\\\\|command\\\\b\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/cli-surface/advisor-recommend.md | head -18; echo \\\"=== CLI surface ===\\\"; grep -n \\\"policy\\\\|mutating\\\\|holdout\\\\|child\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/cli-surface/skill-advisor-cli.md | head -18\"},\"output\":\"3:description: \\\"Native command that returns prompt-safe skill recommendations with lane attribution, lifecycle metadata, fail-open freshness semantics and an optional compiled-routing enrichment.\\\"\\n17:Expose the native scoring pipeline as a command that any runtime can call through the CLI front door, with prompt-safe attribution and lifecycle-aware redirects.\\n23:`handlers/advisor-recommend.ts` implements the command. Input is validated by `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts` (Zod strict). The public response always includes the resolved `workspaceRoot` plus `effectiveThresholds`, where `effectiveThresholds` publishes the active `confidenceThreshold`, `uncertaintyThreshold` and `confidenceOnly` mode after request overrides are merged with defaults. Output also carries prompt-safe `recommendations[]`, optional `laneBreakdown[]` when `includeAttribution: true`, lifecycle redirect metadata (`redirectFrom`, `redirectTo`, `status`), `freshness`, `trustState`, `generatedAt`, `cache`, optional `warnings` and optional `abstainReasons`. Fail-open states such as disabled or absent freshness still preserve `workspaceRoot` and `effectiveThresholds` in the envelope so callers can inspect the resolved repository scope and active routing thre...\n  Line 172: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794551290074,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2c799690ffeJQrMJ5OzboPGaV\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d397033c001ZdaNYQ5ZGsGtLG\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2c799690ffeJQrMJ5OzboPGaV\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d396c355001B6tQhk3bhKw6Rd\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_cb39016e2c3a4c2096199fbe\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"content\":\"# Review Iteration 003\\n\\n## Dispatcher\\n\\n- Mode: review (fan-out lineage `render-hooks-plugin`)\\n- Session: `fanout-render-hooks-plugin-1794550137809-1ecgc7`, generation 1, lineage mode `new`\\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\\n- Area: `render-hooks-plugin`\\n- Operator review focus addressed this iteration: \\\"docs that disagree with code\\\". Every document in this area was read against the exact code it describes, and each cla