ompiledRoute: { type: 'boolean', description: 'Attach compiled\\nskill-advisor-cli-manifest.ts:58 => compiledRouteTopOnly: { type: 'boolean', description: 'Attach compiled\\ntools/advisor-recommend.ts:23 => includeCompiledRoute: { type: 'boolean', description: 'Attach compiled\\ntools/advisor-recommend.ts...\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/plan.md:\n  Line 425: **Decision**: Add the request option `compiledRouteTopOnly`. The hook sends it, and `enrichCompiledRoutes` then looks up the route for the first recommendation alone.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/logs/w0a-T054.out:\n  Line 10: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794521847910,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2e2a7dd5ffeKSW8P83xK0M1au\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d1d6558a001gQFMm3anhNqFf9\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2e2a7dd5ffeKSW8P83xK0M1au\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d1d645a3001GNeacWs01WdAcU\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_32768533576a4fa2987cdf47\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md\",\"offset\":130,\"limit\":90},\"output\":\"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md, lines 130-219\\n130: {\\\"correct\\\":24,\\\"total\\\":44}\\n131: {\\\"tune\\\":{\\\"own\\\":2,\\\"attached\\\":7,\\\"combined\\\":9,\\\"total\\\":45},\\\"holdout\\\":{\\\"own\\\":0,\\\"attached\\\":0,\\\"combined\\\":0,\\\"total\\\":44}}\\n132: {\\\"count\\\