":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\", \"oldString\": \"<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\\n- P1 (Required): 0\\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\\n- Resolved: 0\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\", \"newString\": \"<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\\n- P1 (Required): 0\\n- P2 (Suggestions): 2\\n- Resolved: 0\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\"}"},"time":{"start":1794670773169,"end":1794670783208}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794670783218,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffe8tw0MjspShTXDB","part":{"partID":"prt_1dab6cc6100109VtIIyGFNAAxq","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffe8tw0MjspShTXDB","messageID":"msg_1dab69b4f001sotPDuILIlJp9j","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-89612d8b85cbd1d3","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md","oldString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---","newString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Comparing the Codex read path against the other three path-locator readers found the same-class miss in one read: `rg -n \"readFileSync\\(transcriptPath\"` returns only `codex.mjs:167`, while the pass-two fix covers `claude.mjs:219`, `devin.mjs:356` and `dsh.mjs:313` (iteration 1).\n- Reading the plugin's new top-only request through the handler and the renderer's first-passing selection showed the head-command gap is reachable, not just inferred: a failing row 0 spends the single route lookup and a passing row 1 leads without a command (iteration 1).\n- Checking the prompt cache's stored value before calling the route-option omission a defect avoided a false finding: the cache holds the un-enriched `parsed` output, so no lower-row command can be inherited (iteration 1).\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- The first pass through the plugin change looked for an in-plugin route-lookup bug; the actual gap lives across three files (plugin request, handler branch, renderer selection), so the cross-file read is what made it visible (iteration 1).\n- Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \"{}\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).\n\n---"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -88,15 +88,18 @@\n <!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n \n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n \n-[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- Comparing the Codex read path against the other three path-locator readers found the same-class miss in one read: `rg -n \"readFileSync\\(transcriptPath\"` returns only `codex.mjs:167`, while the pass-two fix covers `claude.mjs:219`, `devin.mjs:356` and `dsh.mjs:313` (iteration 1).\n+- Reading the plugin's new top-only request through the handler and the renderer's first-passing selection showed the head-command gap is reachable, not just inferred: a failing row 0 spends the single route lookup and a passing row 1 leads without a command (iteration 1).\n+- Checking the prompt cache's stored value before calling the route-option omission a defect avoided a false finding: the cache holds the un-enriched `parsed` output, so no lower-row command can be inherited (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n-[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- The first pass through the plugin change looked for an in-plugin route-lookup bug; the actual gap lives across three files (plugin request, handler branch, renderer selection), so the cross-file read is what made it visible (iteration 1).\n+- Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \"{}\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":5,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\", \"oldString\": \"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\", \"newString\": \"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n- Comparing the Codex read path against the other three path-locator readers found the same-class miss in one read: `rg -n \\\"readFileSync\\\\(transcriptPath\\\"` returns only `codex.mjs:167`, while the pass-two fix covers `claude.mjs:219`, `devin.mjs:356` and `dsh.mjs:313` (iteration 1).\\n- Reading the plugin's new top-only request through the handler and the renderer's first-passing selection showed the head-command gap is reachable, not just inferred: a failing row 0 spends the single route lookup and a passing row 1 leads without a command (iteration 1).\\n- Checking the prompt cache's stored value before calling the route-option omission a defect avoided a false finding: the cache holds the un-enriched `parsed` output, so no lower-row command can be inherited (iteration 1).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- The first pass through the plugin change looked for an in-plugin route-lookup bug; the actual gap lives across three files (plugin request, handler branch, renderer selection), so the cross-file read is what made it visible (iteration 1).\\n- Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \\\"{}\\\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).\\n\\n---\"}"},"time":{"start":1794670775393,"end":1794670783218}}}}
