g/008-command-surfacing-build/025-release-notes-and-doc-sync/spec.md:87:37:The request option `options.compiledRouteTopOnly` is an optional boolean that defaults to false. When a caller passes `true`, `enrichCompiledRoutes()` runs the route lookup for the first recommendation only and returns every later one unchanged, so only the top pick can carry `compiledRoute` or `command`. ...\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/025-release-notes-and-doc-sync/spec.md:105:| `feature-catalog/cli-surface/advisor-recommend.md` | Under the top-only option only the top pick can carry a command, and nothing says when a command is withheld | Phase 021 for the head row, phase 020 for the withhold |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/025-release-notes-and-doc-sync/spec.md:118:- Correct the `command-attach.ts` row, the two case counts, the top-only sentence, the meaning-pass bar and the two companion lines.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/025-release-notes-and-doc-sync/spec.md:138:| `SKA/feature-catalog/cli-surface/advisor-recommend.md` | Modify | The top-only sentence and the withheld command |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -n \\\"top-only\\\\|top only\\\\|compiledRouteTopOnly\\\\|OpenCode plugin\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/025-release-notes-and-doc-sync/tasks.md specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/025-release-notes-and-doc-sync/spec.md | head -30\"}"},"time":{"start":1794670888782,"end":1794670890499}}}}
