{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794671034386,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffe8tw0MjspShTXDB","part":{"partID":"prt_1daba8ef3001PLVfzU4AEKl1SP","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffe8tw0MjspShTXDB","messageID":"msg_1daba7e090014mO2am1V5cEJbX","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-841eb8e1a00ffd7a","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md","oldString":"- Checking the prompt cache's stored value before calling the route-option omission a defect avoided a false finding: the cache holds the un-enriched `parsed` output, so no lower-row command can be inherited (iteration 1).","newString":"- Checking the prompt cache's stored value before calling the route-option omission a defect avoided a false finding: the cache holds the un-enriched `parsed` output, so no lower-row command can be inherited (iteration 1).\n- Comparing the README companion sentence with the child test at `doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts:84` made the doc gap concrete: the page names only run/start/ask while the code prints `parent-named only` (iteration 2).\n- Reading the full doctor row table against `parentNamedOnly` showed every mutating class is covered: `start`, `ask`, and `run` with `mutates` or `add-only` all downgrade in a child, while read-only `run` stays visible (iteration 2)."},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n-