{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794671034393,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffe8tw0MjspShTXDB","part":{"partID":"prt_1daba97b4001BGWficAo31O1kO","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffe8tw0MjspShTXDB","messageID":"msg_1daba7e090014mO2am1V5cEJbX","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8cb49ca3ac71f0d4","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md","oldString":"- Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \"{}\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).","newString":"- Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \"{}\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).\n- The first read of the ambiguous partner suppression looked like a testable defect, but the generated doctor table has unique commands and the partner skill is already excluded by `companion.skill !== shownSecond`; it stayed an edge case, not a finding (iteration 2)."},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -101,8 +101,9 @@\n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n - The first pass through the plugin change looked for an in-plugin route-lookup bug; the actual gap lives across three files (plugin request, handler branch, renderer selection), so the cross-file read is what made it visible (iteration 1).\n - Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \"{}\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).\n+- The first read of the ambiguous partner suppression looked like a testable defect, but the generated doctor table has unique commands and the partner skill is already excluded by `companion.skill !== shownSecond`; it stayed an edge case, not a finding (iteration 2).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\", \"oldString\": \"- Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \\\"{}\\\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).\", \"newString\": \"- Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \\\"{}\\\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).\\n- The first read of the ambiguous partner suppression looked like a testable defect, but the generated doctor table has unique commands and the partner skill is already excluded by `companion.skill !== shownSecond`; it stayed an edge case, not a finding (iteration 2).\"}"},"time":{"start":1794671024052,"end":1794671034393}}}}
