{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794671232160,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffe8tw0MjspShTXDB","part":{"partID":"prt_1dabdafe8001EblvkJrJVlWEXd","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffe8tw0MjspShTXDB","messageID":"msg_1dabd82aa001JZCjXlOwhavZ6f","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a2a981dd15b4a1d","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md","oldString":"- The first read of the ambiguous partner suppression looked like a testable defect, but the generated doctor table has unique commands and the partner skill is already excluded by `companion.skill !== shownSecond`; it stayed an edge case, not a finding (iteration 2).","newString":"- The first read of the ambiguous partner suppression looked like a testable defect, but the generated doctor table has unique commands and the partner skill is already excluded by `companion.skill !== shownSecond`; it stayed an edge case, not a finding (iteration 2).\n- The first pass through the plugin's timeout test suspected the timer spy hid a real-time regression, but the same test asserts both delivered signals, so the spy strengthens rather than weakens the coverage (iteration 3).\n- No new finding was found in the third pass; the changed set is exhausted for maintainability, and the two open code/doc findings are carried, not re-raised (iteration 3)."},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -103,8 +103,10 @@\n \n - The first pass through the plugin change looked for an in-plugin route-lookup bug; the actual gap lives across three files (plugin request, handler branch, renderer selection), so the cross-file read is what made it visible (iteration 1).\n - Treating the codex reader's `custom_tool_call` body as fully covered by its test missed the `arguments: \"{}\"` plus `input` edge; recording it as an edge case kept it from becoming a speculative finding (iteration 1).\n - The first read of the ambiguous partner suppression looked like a testable defect, but the generated doctor table has unique commands and the partner skill is already excluded by `companion.skill !== shownSecond`; it stayed an edge case, not a finding (iteration 2).\n+- The first pass through the plugin's timeout test suspected the timer spy hid a real-time regression, but the same test asserts both delivered signals, so the spy strengthens rather than weakens the coverage (iteration 3).\n+- No new finding was found in the third pass; the changed set is exhausted for maintainability, and the two open code/doc findings are carried, not re-raised (iteration 3).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin-4/deep-review-strategy.md\", \"oldString\": \"- The first read of the ambiguous partner suppression looked like a testable defect, but the generated doctor table has unique commands and the partner skill is already excluded by `companion.skill !== shownSecond`; it stayed an edge case, not a finding (iteration 2).\", \"newString\": \"- The first read of the ambiguous partner suppression looked like a testable defect, but the generated doctor table has unique commands and the partner skill is already excluded by `companion.skill !== shownSecond`; it stayed an edge case, not a finding (iteration 2).\\n- The first pass through the plugin's timeout test suspected the timer spy hid a real-time regression, but the same test asserts both delivered signals, so the spy strengthens rather than weakens the coverage (iteration 3).\\n- No new finding was found in the third pass; the changed set is exhausted for maintainability, and the two open code/doc findings are carried, not re-raised (iteration 3).\"}"},"time":{"start":1794671226857,"end":1794671232160}}}}
